{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2225","endTime":324438.006,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 11\nUmeed.\n\nA matrimony website presentation with member discovery, membership information, and profile-led content.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nMatrimony & discovery\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nAn introduction to meaningful connections.\n\nUmeed’s web artwork presents a matrimony service through an introductory banner, profile discovery controls, and membership sections. Member cards make people the focal point of the page. The available project-specific website graphics retain the identity shown in Clarigo’s original portfolio.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Umeed's original project material.\n\n01\nMember discovery\n\nVisible search controls provide an introduction to browsing profiles.\n\n02\nProfile cards\n\nMember imagery and compact information panels lead the content.\n\n03\nMembership information\n\nDedicated sections explain membership options in the interface.\n\n04\nPublic navigation\n\nThe site header includes informational and account entry points.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nMatrimony & discovery\n\nMagenta and deep purple frame a bright, celebratory identity. Photography, compact profile cards, and prominent membership panels create a visually layered page, with the header providing clear routes to the main site areas.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Umeed.\n\nExplore the original design compositions. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nUmeed's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nUmeed / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nAlum-connect\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nEDUCATION & SERVICES\nAlum-connect\nEXERCISE & WELLBEING\nKegelklock\nSPORTS & COACHING\nBR-tennis\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
